sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as 📱 Guest phone
  participant IN as 📥 guestOrders inbox
  participant CF as ⚙️ Cloud Function
  participant O as 🧾 orders
  participant ST as 🧑‍💼 Staff (Orders / Tables)
  participant K as 👨‍🍳 Kitchen
  G->>IN: Place order (table token, visitId, partyId, lines, OTP phone)
  IN->>CF: onCreate
  CF->>CF: Validate table token, visit, party, prices (never trust client)
  alt Group's first order
    CF->>O: Copy as status = new (pendingApproval)
    O-->>ST: Banner: "T6 · new group · Accept?"
    ST->>O: Accept
  else Later orders of same group
    CF->>O: Copy as accepted
  end
  O-->>K: KOT per station
  K-->>G: Live status Preparing → Ready → Served
